# F14 step 1: ofx's own drag dropped back on its own window: known by its own type, counted as its
# own and not read (its files are the drag's), and the window keeps answering. Layout as
# dnd.script, with no peer: ofx fills the output.
settle
key down
sh vptr move 200 300 press wait 1500 move 300 300 move 400 200 wait 300 release >"$OFX_ROOT/vptr.log" 2>&1 &
wait-for 3000 dndpress=1
drag-out
wait-for 3000 dndover=1
expect dndaction=1
wait-for 4000 owndrops=1 dndover=0
expect drops=0 dropfail=0 dndreading=0 dndsent=0
key down
expect sel=b.txt
quit
